  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Women&apos;s Conference</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Main activity: 
-	Organise an International Women&#x2019;s Conference on Transformational Leadership in Juba
Objectives: 
-	create a space for women leaders to reflect on their personal leadership journeys as they share perspectives and recommendations on the role of women in leadership and decision making across peace and security domains 
-	deliberate on actions and strategies to strengthen women&#x2019;s participation and leadership; safeguard and deepen gains made; engage with young women to bridge the generational gap, promote inclusion of all women including rural women and girls and
-	expand networks for shared learning nationally, regionally, and internationally to build stronger women&#x2019;s movements for change</narrative>
  </description>
